e:T2a74d,<p>这份笔记整理 <strong>359 篇主会论文</strong>：CVPR 2026 共 110 篇，ACL 2026 共 249 篇，覆盖 tool calling、多模态、search、GUI / Web、code execution 与 embodied agents。</p>
<p>每篇独立阅读页按 <strong>Idea → Research Problem → Insight → Method</strong> 展开，中文解释保留英文专业术语。Method 写明关键模块、数据与训练流程、执行方式；Sources 提供官方 PDF 与核读页码。</p>
<p><a href="/papers/agent-tool-use-2026/explorer/">打开交互式文献检索</a> · <a href="/papers/agent-tool-use-2026/notes.md">下载全部笔记（Markdown）</a> · <a href="/data/agent-tool-use-2026.json">结构化数据（JSON）</a></p>
<p>仅收录 CVPR Main 与 ACL Long / Short，排除 Findings、Workshop、Industry 和 Demo。172 篇标为直接工具使用，187 篇为相关的执行、规划、记忆、安全和评测研究；九个方向用于阅读导航，边界存在交叉。</p>
<blockquote>
<p>检索日期：2026-10-24。详细笔记依据官方正文整理，Insight 为对论文机制的分析性概括；未独立复现实验，清单不保证零遗漏。正式录用来源为 <a href="https://openaccess.thecvf.com/CVPR2026?day=all">CVF</a> 和 <a href="https://aclanthology.org/events/acl-2026/">ACL Anthology</a>。</p>
</blockquote>
<h2 id="01-工具调用-训练-评测">01 · 工具调用 / 训练 / 评测</h2>
<p>64 篇 · CVPR 8 · ACL 56</p>
<h4 id="epiagent-an-agent-centric-system-for-ancient-inscription-restoration"><a href="/papers/agent-tool-use-2026/reading/c39/">EpiAgent: An Agent-Centric System for Ancient Inscription Restoration</a></h4>
<p>CVPR 2026 · 直接工具使用 · 正文笔记</p>
<p>EpiAgent 将古代碑文修复组织为 Observe–Conceive–Execute–Reevaluate 循环，由 Kimi-K2 central planner 根据文字、字形、损伤程度与历史工具经验，为每个字符制定和修改修复序列。</p>
<h4 id="from-intuition-to-investigation-a-tool-augmented-reasoning-mllm-framework-for-generalizable-face-anti-spoofing"><a href="/papers/agent-tool-use-2026/reading/c44/">From Intuition to Investigation: A Tool-Augmented Reasoning MLLM Framework for Generalizable Face Anti-Spoofing</a></h4>
<p>CVPR 2026 · 直接工具使用 · 正文笔记</p>
<p>TAR-FAS 将 Face Anti-Spoofing 从直观的二分类或简短描述，改成 Chain-of-Thought with Visual Tools：先形成初始判断，再按需检查纹理、频率、边缘或局部区域，最后给出 Real / Spoof 结论。</p>
<h4 id="ipr-1-interactive-physical-reasoner"><a href="/papers/agent-tool-use-2026/reading/c61/">IPR-1: Interactive Physical Reasoner</a></h4>
<p>CVPR 2026 · 直接工具使用 · 正文笔记</p>
<p>IPR-1 用可学习的 physics-centric action code（PhysCode）连接 VLM policy 与 world model。</p>
<h4 id="scaling-agentic-reinforcement-learning-for-tool-integrated-reasoning-in-vlms"><a href="/papers/agent-tool-use-2026/reading/c115/">Scaling Agentic Reinforcement Learning for Tool-Integrated Reasoning in VLMs</a></h4>
<p>CVPR 2026 · 直接工具使用 · 正文笔记</p>
<p>VISTA-Gym 将多种视觉推理任务、26 个工具、可执行交互及可验证答案统一为 agentic RL environment，并训练 VISTA-R1 学习交错 reasoning 与 tool calls。</p>
<h4 id="training-one-model-to-master-cross-level-agentic-actions-via-reinforcement-learning"><a href="/papers/agent-tool-use-2026/reading/c140/">Training One Model to Master Cross-Level Agentic Actions via Reinforcement Learning</a></h4>
<p>CVPR 2026 · 直接工具使用 · 正文笔记</p>
<p>CrossHA 将 action-space selection 与具体动作内容放进同一 policy，在 Minecraft 任务中动态选择 language、grounding、motion、raw 或 latent 等不同层级接口。</p>
<h4 id="drama-next-gen-dynamic-orchestration-for-resilient-multi-agent-ecosystems-in-flux"><a href="/papers/agent-tool-use-2026/reading/c26/">DRAMA: Next-Gen Dynamic Orchestration for Resilient Multi-Agent Ecosystems in Flux</a></h4>
<p>CVPR 2026 · 扩展相关 · 正文笔记</p>
<p>DRAMA 为成员随时加入、退出或恢复的 embodied multi-agent systems 提供动态任务编排。</p>
<h4 id="gtr-turbo-merged-checkpoint-is-secretly-a-free-teacher-for-agentic-vlm-training"><a href="/papers/agent-tool-use-2026/reading/c46/">GTR-Turbo: Merged Checkpoint is Secretly a Free Teacher for Agentic VLM Training</a></h4>
<p>CVPR 2026 · 扩展相关 · 正文笔记</p>
<p>GTR-Turbo 将 agent 在持续 RL 训练中保存的历史 checkpoints 合并为 teacher，用它替代外部昂贵 VLM 的逐步 thought guidance。</p>
<h4 id="vs-bench-evaluating-vlms-for-strategic-abilities-in-multi-agent-environments"><a href="/papers/agent-tool-use-2026/reading/c145/">VS-Bench: Evaluating VLMs for Strategic Abilities in Multi-Agent Environments</a></h4>
<p>CVPR 2026 · 扩展相关 · 正文笔记</p>
<p>VS-Bench 用十种具有图像与文字观察的 multi-agent games 分别测试 VLM 的 perception、strategic reasoning 和 decision-making。</p>
<h4 id="a-multi-agent-framework-for-high-interaction-terminal-simulation"><a href="/papers/agent-tool-use-2026/reading/e185/">A Multi-Agent Framework for High-Interaction Terminal Simulation</a></h4>
<p>ACL 2026 · 直接工具使用 · 正文笔记</p>
<p>MANTIS 将高交互 terminal simulation 拆成命令路由、状态维护与输出生成，通过真实状态快照和 state-aware history pruning 保持多轮一致性。</p>
<h4 id="agentgl-towards-agentic-graph-learning-with-llms-via-reinforcement-learning"><a href="/papers/agent-tool-use-2026/reading/a50/">AgentGL: Towards Agentic Graph Learning with LLMs via Reinforcement Learning</a></h4>
<p>ACL 2026 · 直接工具使用 · 正文笔记</p>
<p>AgentGL 把 Text-Attributed Graph 上的 node classification 与 link prediction 改成 graph-native 工具探索和语言推理交替进行的 RL 问题。</p>
<h4 id="architect-uncertainty-aware-dynamic-tool-learning-via-causal-intervention-for-open-world-agents"><a href="/papers/agent-tool-use-2026/reading/a67/">ARCHITECT: Uncertainty-Aware Dynamic Tool Learning via Causal Intervention for Open-World Agents</a></h4>
<p>ACL 2026 · 直接工具使用 · 正文笔记</p>
<p>ARCHITECT 在动态工具生成、验证、修复和复用中引入 Causal Tool Diagnosis（CTD），同时预测可靠性与 specification/code/environment 三类失败归因。</p>
<h4 id="at²po-agentic-turn-based-policy-optimization-via-tree-search"><a href="/papers/agent-tool-use-2026/reading/e130/">AT²PO: Agentic Turn-based Policy Optimization via Tree Search</a></h4>
<p>ACL 2026 · 直接工具使用 · 正文笔记</p>
<p>AT²PO 将 agentic RL 的采样、credit assignment 与优化粒度统一到 interaction turn：在不确定轮次分支生成轨迹，用树中后继结果估计每轮价值，再以 turn-level importance ratio 更新策略。</p>
<h4 id="autoreproduce-automatic-ai-experiment-reproduction-with-paper-lineage"><a href="/papers/agent-tool-use-2026/reading/d95/">AutoReproduce: Automatic AI Experiment Reproduction with Paper Lineage</a></h4>
<p>ACL 2026 · 直接工具使用 · 正文笔记</p>
<p>AutoReproduce 通过 paper lineage 补全论文没有写明的领域实现惯例，再让 research agent 与 code agent 协作完成数据、方法和实验管线。</p>
<h4 id="beyond-accuracy-unveiling-inefficiency-patterns-in-tool-integrated-reasoning"><a href="/papers/agent-tool-use-2026/reading/a15/">Beyond Accuracy: Unveiling Inefficiency Patterns in Tool-Integrated Reasoning</a></h4>
<p>ACL 2026 · 直接工具使用 · 正文笔记</p>
<p>论文提出 Prefill Token Equivalents（PTE），把 tool-integrated reasoning 中的 prefill、随 context 增长的 decode 访存成本和 KV-cache 不可复用后的重计算折合成同一单位。</p>
<h4 id="car-bench-evaluating-the-consistency-and-limit-awareness-of-llm-agents-under-real-world-uncertainty"><a href="/papers/agent-tool-use-2026/reading/a71/">CAR-bench: Evaluating the Consistency and Limit-Awareness of LLM Agents under Real-World Uncertainty</a></h4>
<p>ACL 2026 · 直接工具使用 · 正文笔记</p>
<p>CAR-bench 在车载助手模拟环境中评估多轮 tool-using agent 的持续可靠性，将任务扩展为正常执行、无法完成时承认能力边界，以及存在歧义时先获取信息。</p>
<h4 id="current-agents-fail-to-leverage-world-model-as-tool-for-foresight"><a href="/papers/agent-tool-use-2026/reading/a34/">Current Agents Fail to Leverage World Model as Tool for Foresight</a></h4>
<p>ACL 2026 · 直接工具使用 · 正文笔记</p>
<p>本文实证检验现有 VLM agents 能否把外部 world model 当作 foresight 工具，而不是提出新的 simulator。</p>
<h4 id="discovery-and-reinforcement-of-tool-integrated-reasoning-chains-via-rollout-trees"><a href="/papers/agent-tool-use-2026/reading/a35/">Discovery and Reinforcement of Tool-Integrated Reasoning Chains via Rollout Trees</a></h4>
<p>ACL 2026 · 直接工具使用 · 正文笔记</p>
<p>DART 在 RL 训练期间对现有 long CoT 轨迹构建 rollout tree，在高不确定且适合工具使用的位置插入提示并分叉，探索 Python 调用能否改善解答。</p>
<h4 id="do-llms-know-tool-irrelevance-demystifying-structural-alignment-bias-in-tool-invocations"><a href="/papers/agent-tool-use-2026/reading/a58/">Do LLMs Know Tool Irrelevance? Demystifying Structural Alignment Bias in Tool Invocations</a></h4>
<p>ACL 2026 · 直接工具使用 · 正文笔记</p>
<p>该研究识别 Structural Alignment Bias：即使工具语义无法满足目标，只要用户属性恰好能填满其参数，模型仍倾向调用。</p>
<h4 id="don-t-adapt-small-language-models-for-tools-adapt-tool-schemas-to-the-models"><a href="/papers/agent-tool-use-2026/reading/a43/">Don’t Adapt Small Language Models for Tools; Adapt Tool Schemas to the Models</a></h4>
<p>ACL 2026 · 直接工具使用 · 正文笔记</p>
<p>PA-Tool 将适配方向从微调 small language model 转为重命名 tool schema：让目标模型依据功能描述多次生成 tool/parameter names，选择输出分布中局部最密集的候选，并建立原名到新名的映射。</p>
<h4 id="empowering-multi-turn-tool-integrated-agentic-reasoning-with-group-turn-policy-optimization"><a href="/papers/agent-tool-use-2026/reading/a73/">Empowering Multi-Turn Tool-Integrated Agentic Reasoning with Group Turn Policy Optimization</a></h4>
<p>ACL 2026 · 直接工具使用 · 正文笔记</p>
<p>GTPO 将多轮 tool-integrated reasoning 的 RL 信号从整条 trajectory 下沉到 turn：每轮分配格式 reward，终局给答案 reward，再以 discounted returns 计算 turn advantages；对最终错误但代码接近成功样本的轨迹提供部分奖励。</p>
<h4 id="et-agent-incentivizing-effective-tool-integrated-reasoning-agent-via-behavior-calibration"><a href="/papers/agent-tool-use-2026/reading/a12/">ET-Agent: Incentivizing Effective Tool-Integrated Reasoning Agent via Behavior Calibration</a></h4>
<p>ACL 2026 · 直接工具使用 · 正文笔记</p>
<p>ET-Agent 将 tool-integrated reasoning 的优化目标扩展到行为校准：通过 Self-Evolving Data Flywheel 增加有效解法，再从准确性与工具次数的组内差异挑选训练题，逐步学习正确、简洁且调用恰当的轨迹。</p>
<h4 id="from-proof-to-program-characterizing-tool-induced-reasoning-hallucinations-in-large-language-models"><a href="/papers/agent-tool-use-2026/reading/a72/">From Proof to Program: Characterizing Tool-Induced Reasoning Hallucinations in Large Language Models</a></h4>
<p>ACL 2026 · 直接工具使用 · 正文笔记</p>
<p>本文提出 Tool-Induced Myopia：即使 Python 工具调用和执行正确，模型也可能把枚举、数值试验的结果当成完整数学论证。</p>
<h4 id="genesisfunc-multi-agent-data-generation-for-accurate-and-generalizable-function-calling"><a href="/papers/agent-tool-use-2026/reading/a55/">GenesisFunc: Multi-Agent Data Generation for Accurate and Generalizable Function-Calling</a></h4>
<p>ACL 2026 · 直接工具使用 · 正文笔记</p>
<p>GenesisFunc 是 function-calling 训练数据生成 pipeline，以筛选后的 benchmark tool schemas 为基础，让多 agent 协同控制工具组合、对话语义多样性、参数覆盖与质量筛查。</p>
<h4 id="learning-from-the-irrecoverable-error-localized-policy-optimization-for-tool-integrated-llm-reasoning"><a href="/papers/agent-tool-use-2026/reading/a24/">Learning from the Irrecoverable: Error-Localized Policy Optimization for Tool-Integrated LLM Reasoning</a></h4>
<p>ACL 2026 · 直接工具使用 · 正文笔记</p>
<p>ELPO 从失败轨迹中定位首个在当前采样预算下不可恢复的步骤，再围绕该位置分配信用和强化纠错更新。</p>
<h4 id="looptool-closing-the-data-training-loop-for-robust-llm-tool-calls"><a href="/papers/agent-tool-use-2026/reading/a45/">LoopTool: Closing the Data–Training Loop for Robust LLM Tool Calls</a></h4>
<p>ACL 2026 · 直接工具使用 · 正文笔记</p>
<p>LoopTool 把 tool-call 数据生成与模型训练闭合成迭代循环：训练后用当前模型探测失败，判断错误来自预测还是旧标签，修正监督并围绕已验证弱点扩展新数据。</p>
<h4 id="lost-in-execution-on-the-multilingual-robustness-of-tool-calling-in-large-language-models"><a href="/papers/agent-tool-use-2026/reading/a78/">Lost in Execution: On the Multilingual Robustness of Tool Calling in Large Language Models</a></h4>
<p>ACL 2026 · 直接工具使用 · 正文笔记</p>
<p>MLCL 将 multilingual tool calling 作为语言输入与固定执行接口之间的诊断问题，系统改变用户 query 的语言组成和措辞，同时保持 English-only tool schemas 不变。</p>
<h4 id="mcp-flow-facilitating-llm-agents-to-master-real-world-diverse-and-scaling-mcp-tools"><a href="/papers/agent-tool-use-2026/reading/a7/">MCP-Flow: Facilitating LLM Agents to Master Real-World, Diverse and Scaling MCP Tools</a></h4>
<p>ACL 2026 · 直接工具使用 · 正文笔记</p>
<p>MCP-Flow 建立从真实 MCP marketplace 发现服务器、获取工具 schema、合成指令调用到模型训练的可扩展流水线。</p>
<h4 id="octotools-a-multi-agent-framework-with-extensible-tools-for-complex-reasoning"><a href="/papers/agent-tool-use-2026/reading/a0/">OctoTools: A Multi-Agent Framework with Extensible Tools for Complex Reasoning</a></h4>
<p>ACL 2026 · 直接工具使用 · 正文笔记</p>
<p>OctoTools 用标准化 tool cards 连接 planner 与 executor：planner 负责整体目标和逐步子目标，executor 将文字动作转换成可运行 Python 命令，执行结果回到共享轨迹以继续规划和检查。</p>
<h4 id="optico-adaptive-distributed-training-optimization-via-collaborative-agent-reasoning"><a href="/papers/agent-tool-use-2026/reading/e155/">OptiCo: Adaptive Distributed Training Optimization via Collaborative Agent Reasoning</a></h4>
<p>ACL 2026 · 直接工具使用 · 正文笔记</p>
<p>OptiCo 把 distributed training configuration tuning 组织成四个专职 agent 的闭环：定位瓶颈、提出参数修改、真实启动验证、分析失败，并把所有结果保存在 Global Message Pool。</p>
<h4 id="r2if-aligning-reasoning-with-decisions-via-composite-rewards-for-interpretable-llm-function-calling"><a href="/papers/agent-tool-use-2026/reading/a68/">R2IF: Aligning Reasoning with Decisions via Composite Rewards for Interpretable LLM Function Calling</a></h4>
<p>ACL 2026 · 直接工具使用 · 正文笔记</p>
<p>R2IF 用复合奖励让 function calling 的解释真正支持最终决策：除了格式与调用正确性，还衡量 reasoning prefix 是否提升 student 的调用成功率，以及是否明确说明参数 specification、modification 和 value。</p>
<h4 id="rethinking-the-role-of-entropy-in-optimizing-tool-use-behaviors-for-large-language-model-agents"><a href="/papers/agent-tool-use-2026/reading/a54/">Rethinking the Role of Entropy in Optimizing Tool-Use Behaviors for Large Language Model Agents</a></h4>
<p>ACL 2026 · 直接工具使用 · 正文笔记</p>
<p>TEPO 用工具调用前后 reasoning segments 的 next-token entropy 变化作为工具质量代理，将其嵌入 GRPO。</p>
<h4 id="reviewgrounder-improving-review-substantiveness-with-rubric-guided-tool-integrated-agents"><a href="/papers/agent-tool-use-2026/reading/a59/">ReviewGrounder: Improving Review Substantiveness with Rubric-Guided, Tool-Integrated Agents</a></h4>
<p>ACL 2026 · 直接工具使用 · 正文笔记</p>
<p>ReviewGrounder 将审稿拆成 draft、针对性 grounding 和 rubric-guided synthesis：先生成结构完整的初稿，再分别核查相关文献、方法论和实验，最后根据通用 reviewer rubrics 形成具体反馈。</p>
<h4 id="rimrule-improving-tool-using-language-agents-via-mdl-guided-rule-learning"><a href="/papers/agent-tool-use-2026/reading/a64/">RIMRULE: Improving Tool-Using Language Agents via MDL-Guided Rule Learning</a></h4>
<p>ACL 2026 · 直接工具使用 · 正文笔记</p>
<p>RIMRULE 从工具代理的失败经验提炼短规则，使用 Minimum Description Length 整合为精简规则库，推理时按当前任务和工具动态注入。</p>
<h4 id="robust-tool-use-via-fission-grpo-learning-to-recover-from-execution-errors"><a href="/papers/agent-tool-use-2026/reading/a70/">Robust Tool Use via Fission-GRPO: Learning to Recover from Execution Errors</a></h4>
<p>ACL 2026 · 直接工具使用 · 正文笔记</p>
<p>Fission-GRPO 把当前策略产生的 tool-call 错误转换成新的 recovery contexts，并从每个错误重新采样一组修复尝试。</p>
<h4 id="tea-bench-a-systematic-benchmarking-of-tool-enhanced-emotional-support-dialogue-agent"><a href="/papers/agent-tool-use-2026/reading/a82/">TEA-Bench: A Systematic Benchmarking of Tool-enhanced Emotional Support Dialogue Agent</a></h4>
<p>ACL 2026 · 直接工具使用 · 正文笔记</p>
<p>TEA-Bench 把 emotional support conversation 的评价从共情表达扩展到 tool-grounded instrumental support，要求现实性建议中的时间、地点、天气等事实可追溯。</p>
<h4 id="temp-r1-a-unified-autonomous-agent-for-complex-temporal-kgqa-via-reverse-curriculum-reinforcement-learning"><a href="/papers/agent-tool-use-2026/reading/e141/">Temp-R1: A Unified Autonomous Agent for Complex Temporal KGQA via Reverse Curriculum Reinforcement Learning</a></h4>
<p>ACL 2026 · 直接工具使用 · 正文笔记</p>
<p>Temp-R1 将 temporal KGQA 从固定多组件流程转为单个可训练代理，并显式区分 plan、filter、rank 等内部动作与 search 外部动作。</p>
<h4 id="the-confidence-dichotomy-analyzing-and-mitigating-miscalibration-in-tool-use-agents"><a href="/papers/agent-tool-use-2026/reading/a25/">The Confidence Dichotomy: Analyzing and Mitigating Miscalibration in Tool-Use Agents</a></h4>
<p>ACL 2026 · 直接工具使用 · 正文笔记</p>
<p>论文先比较 evidence tools 与 verification tools 对 agent verbalized confidence 的不同影响，再提出 Calibration Agentic RL，联合优化答案准确率和显式置信度。</p>
<h4 id="the-reasoning-trap-how-enhancing-llm-reasoning-amplifies-tool-hallucination"><a href="/papers/agent-tool-use-2026/reading/a17/">The Reasoning Trap: How Enhancing LLM Reasoning Amplifies Tool Hallucination</a></h4>
<p>ACL 2026 · 直接工具使用 · 正文笔记</p>
<p>论文用 SimpleToolHalluBench 专门测试 agent 在缺少适用工具时能否 abstain，并追踪 reasoning enhancement 与 tool hallucination 的关系。</p>
<h4 id="tinr-exploring-tool-internalized-reasoning-in-large-language-models"><a href="/papers/agent-tool-use-2026/reading/a79/">TInR: Exploring Tool-Internalized Reasoning in Large Language Models</a></h4>
<p>ACL 2026 · 直接工具使用 · 正文笔记</p>
<p>TInR-U 探索 Tool-Internalized Reasoning：把工具功能、schema 与使用方式编码进模型参数，并以专属 tool tokens 统一推理和调用，使推理时无需把完整工具文档塞进上下文。</p>
<h4 id="toolprm-fine-grained-inference-scaling-of-structured-outputs-for-function-calling"><a href="/papers/agent-tool-use-2026/reading/a40/">ToolPRM: Fine-Grained Inference Scaling of Structured Outputs for Function Calling</a></h4>
<p>ACL 2026 · 直接工具使用 · 正文笔记</p>
<p>ToolPRM 将 structured function calling 拆成函数选择、参数名称和值填充等 intra-call 决策，训练逐步评分器并指导 beam search。</p>
<h4 id="trajectory2task-training-robust-tool-calling-agents-with-synthesized-yet-verifiable-data-for-complex-user-intents"><a href="/papers/agent-tool-use-2026/reading/a77/">Trajectory2Task: Training Robust Tool-Calling Agents with Synthesized Yet Verifiable Data for Complex User Intents</a></h4>
<p>ACL 2026 · 直接工具使用 · 正文笔记</p>
<p>Trajectory2Task 采用 trajectory-first 数据合成：先在可执行工具环境中探索真实可运行的调用链，再反向生成用户任务，并加入 ambiguous、changing、infeasible intent。</p>
<h4 id="unlocking-implicit-experience-synthesizing-tool-use-trajectories-from-text"><a href="/papers/agent-tool-use-2026/reading/a21/">Unlocking Implicit Experience: Synthesizing Tool-Use Trajectories from Text</a></h4>
<p>ACL 2026 · 直接工具使用 · 正文笔记</p>
<p>GEM 提出 Text-to-Trajectory 数据范式：从网页语料中已有的操作经验抽取任务、工具与流程，再合成多轮工具交互。</p>
<h4 id="zara-training-free-motion-time-series-reasoning-via-evidence-grounded-llm-agents"><a href="/papers/agent-tool-use-2026/reading/e81/">ZARA: Training-Free Motion Time-Series Reasoning via Evidence-Grounded LLM Agents</a></h4>
<p>ACL 2026 · 直接工具使用 · 正文笔记</p>
<p>ZARA 把运动传感器序列转为可解释统计证据，由 LLM agents 逐步挑特征、排除活动并作最终判断。</p>
<h4 id="aciarena-toward-unified-evaluation-for-agent-cascading-injection"><a href="/papers/agent-tool-use-2026/reading/e46/">ACIArena: Toward Unified Evaluation for Agent Cascading Injection</a></h4>
<p>ACL 2026 · 扩展相关 · 正文笔记</p>
<p>ACIArena 以统一接口评测 Agent Cascading Injection：将多种 MAS、不同注入入口和攻击目标组合成可扩展测试环境，观察受损 Agent 的内容如何通过协作传播。</p>
<h4 id="action-boundary-blindness-when-llm-agents-cannot-tell-where-one-action-ends-and-another-begins"><a href="/papers/agent-tool-use-2026/reading/e203/">Action Boundary Blindness: When LLM Agents Cannot Tell Where One Action Ends and Another Begins</a></h4>
<p>ACL 2026 · 扩展相关 · 正文笔记</p>
<p>论文将 Action Boundary Blindness 定义为 agent 即使选对 action type，仍误判执行 granularity、scope 或 completion 的现象。</p>
<h4 id="agentgym2-benchmarking-large-language-model-agents-in-de-idealized-real-world-environments"><a href="/papers/agent-tool-use-2026/reading/e236/">AgentGym2: Benchmarking Large Language Model Agents in De-Idealized Real-World Environments</a></h4>
<p>ACL 2026 · 扩展相关 · 正文笔记</p>
<p>AgentGym2 以去除理想化条件的开放数字环境评测 LLM Agent：仅提供基础可组合工具，让 Agent 自行发现额外接口、处理原始附件和噪声，并完成复杂工具使用、端到端数据分析与 deep search。</p>
<h4 id="agentocr-reimagining-agent-history-via-optical-self-compression"><a href="/papers/agent-tool-use-2026/reading/e21/">AgentOCR: Reimagining Agent History via Optical Self-Compression</a></h4>
<p>ACL 2026 · 扩展相关 · 正文笔记</p>
<p>AgentOCR 将不断增长的 observation–action 历史渲染为图像，让 VLM 以较少 visual tokens 读取历史；segment optical caching 复用重复文本片段的渲染结果，self-compression 则把下一步图像压缩率作为 Agent 的显式决策，与任务成功共同进行 RL 优化。</p>
<h4 id="behavior-knowledge-merge-in-reinforced-agentic-models"><a href="/papers/agent-tool-use-2026/reading/e186/">Behavior Knowledge Merge in Reinforced Agentic Models</a></h4>
<p>ACL 2026 · 扩展相关 · 正文笔记</p>
<p>Reinforced Agent Merging（RAM）按 RL task vectors 的重叠分布合并不同领域 agents：多个任务共同更新的参数取平均，仅一个任务更新的参数保留原强度；RAM+ 再依据 overlap/unique ratio 放大 unique updates，以减少合并后的能力稀释。</p>
<h4 id="can-we-predict-before-executing-machine-learning-agents"><a href="/papers/agent-tool-use-2026/reading/e18/">Can We Predict Before Executing Machine Learning Agents?</a></h4>
<p>ACL 2026 · 扩展相关 · 正文笔记</p>
<p>FOREAGENT 在 ML agent 的 candidate generation 与昂贵执行之间加入 Data-centric Solution Preference：给 LLM task description、Verified Data Analysis Report 和两份候选代码，先预测哪份更值得运行。</p>
<h4 id="dpepo-diverse-parallel-exploration-policy-optimization-for-llm-based-agents"><a href="/papers/agent-tool-use-2026/reading/e245/">DPEPO: Diverse Parallel Exploration Policy Optimization for LLM-based Agents</a></h4>
<p>ACL 2026 · 扩展相关 · 正文笔记</p>
<p>DPEPO 让一个 LLM agent 同时控制多个从相同初始状态出发的 environment copies，并共享各分支 observation。</p>
<h4 id="hierarchical-reinforcement-learning-with-augmented-step-level-transitions-for-llm-agents"><a href="/papers/agent-tool-use-2026/reading/e30/">Hierarchical Reinforcement Learning with Augmented Step-Level Transitions for LLM Agents</a></h4>
<p>ACL 2026 · 扩展相关 · 正文笔记</p>
<p>STEP-HRL 用 high-level subtask policy、low-level action policy 与 local-progress policy 共同替代不断增长的完整历史。</p>
<h4 id="impatient-users-confuse-ai-agents-high-fidelity-simulations-of-human-traits-for-testing-agents"><a href="/papers/agent-tool-use-2026/reading/e206/">Impatient Users Confuse AI Agents: High-fidelity Simulations of Human Traits for Testing Agents</a></h4>
<p>ACL 2026 · 扩展相关 · 正文笔记</p>
<p>TraitBasis 用 activation steering 控制 user simulator 的 impatience、skepticism、confusion、incoherence 等 traits，并将其强度与组合系统化，用于测试 conversational agent 在相同任务目标、不同交互行为下的稳健性。</p>
<h4 id="lost-in-simulation-llm-simulated-users-are-unreliable-proxies-for-human-users-in-agentic-evaluations"><a href="/papers/agent-tool-use-2026/reading/e247/">Lost in Simulation: LLM-Simulated Users are Unreliable Proxies for Human Users in Agentic Evaluations</a></h4>
<p>ACL 2026 · 扩展相关 · 正文笔记</p>
<p>这篇工作审计 LLM-simulated users 是否能替代真实用户评价 tool-use agents：固定 agent，分别改变 user model，并让不同地区与语言背景的人完成相同 retail tasks，比较 success rate、simulation–human calibration 和交互失败模式。</p>
<h4 id="mixture-of-minds-multi-agent-reinforcement-learning-for-table-understanding"><a href="/papers/agent-tool-use-2026/reading/e15/">Mixture-of-Minds: Multi-Agent Reinforcement Learning for Table Understanding</a></h4>
<p>ACL 2026 · 扩展相关 · 正文笔记</p>
<p>Mixture-of-Minds 将 table reasoning 分为 Planning、Coding、Answering 三种 agent roles，通过真实 code execution 得到可核对的 intermediate tables，再进行答案生成。</p>
<h4 id="mock-worlds-real-skills-building-small-agentic-language-models-with-synthetic-tasks-simulated-environments-and-rubric-based-rewards"><a href="/papers/agent-tool-use-2026/reading/a30/">Mock Worlds, Real Skills: Building Small Agentic Language Models with Synthetic Tasks, Simulated Environments, and Rubric-Based Rewards</a></h4>
<p>ACL 2026 · 扩展相关 · 正文笔记</p>
<p>SynthAgent 同时合成 tool-use tasks、专属 virtual APIs、mock users 和 mock tools，再从 workflow 与 teacher demonstrations 中提取 task-level rubrics，供小模型进行 agentic RL。</p>
<h4 id="neoamt-neologism-aware-agentic-machine-translation-with-reinforcement-learning"><a href="/papers/agent-tool-use-2026/reading/e32/">NeoAMT: Neologism-Aware Agentic Machine Translation with Reinforcement Learning</a></h4>
<p>ACL 2026 · 扩展相关 · 正文笔记</p>
<p>NeoAMT 把 neologism-aware translation 做成可主动查词的 agentic process：模型先 reasoning，再按需检索 Wiktionary definitions，结合词义修订译文。</p>
<h4 id="recreate-reasoning-and-creating-domain-agents-driven-by-experience"><a href="/papers/agent-tool-use-2026/reading/e175/">ReCreate: Reasoning and Creating Domain Agents Driven by Experience</a></h4>
<p>ACL 2026 · 扩展相关 · 正文笔记</p>
<p>ReCreate 让一个 agent-as-optimizer 阅读 task agent 的 trajectories、execution logs 与 evaluation results，再修改其 scaffold 中的 roles、workflow、tools 和 memory。</p>
<h4 id="reinforcement-learning-for-self-improving-agent-with-skill-library"><a href="/papers/agent-tool-use-2026/reading/e11/">Reinforcement Learning for Self-Improving Agent with Skill Library</a></h4>
<p>ACL 2026 · 扩展相关 · 正文笔记</p>
<p>SAGE 将 Skill Library 的生成与复用纳入同一次 RL rollout：agent 连续解决相似任务，第一题产生的 executable function 可被第二题使用，后续成功复用的收益再奖励前面的 skill generation。</p>
<h4 id="stapo-selective-trajectory-aware-policy-optimization-for-llm-agent-training"><a href="/papers/agent-tool-use-2026/reading/e160/">STAPO: Selective Trajectory-Aware Policy Optimization for LLM Agent Training</a></h4>
<p>ACL 2026 · 扩展相关 · 正文笔记</p>
<p>STAPO 先在相同 anchor state 的 actions 中对 entropy 做 normalization，定位异常步骤，再选择性地奖励 policy 对 task goal 与 history 的依赖，并限制 trajectory-blind policy 的漂移。</p>
<h4 id="taming-actor-observer-asymmetry-in-agents-via-dialectical-alignment"><a href="/papers/agent-tool-use-2026/reading/e129/">Taming Actor-Observer Asymmetry in Agents via Dialectical Alignment</a></h4>
<p>ACL 2026 · 扩展相关 · 正文笔记</p>
<p>ReTAS 通过 Thesis–Antithesis–Synthesis 训练 agent 在失败诊断时先表达角色视角，再检查反面证据，最后输出 attribution 与 corrective action。</p>
<h4 id="timely-machine-awareness-of-time-makes-test-time-scaling-agentic"><a href="/papers/agent-tool-use-2026/reading/a4/">Timely Machine: Awareness of Time Makes Test-Time Scaling Agentic</a></h4>
<p>ACL 2026 · 扩展相关 · 正文笔记</p>
<p>Timely Machine 用 wall-clock time 重新定义 agentic test-time scaling，让 agent 根据剩余时间与实际 tool latency 调整 reasoning 和 interaction。</p>
<h4 id="towards-robust-real-world-spreadsheet-understanding-with-multi-agent-multi-format-reasoning"><a href="/papers/agent-tool-use-2026/reading/e14/">Towards Robust Real-World Spreadsheet Understanding with Multi-Agent Multi-Format Reasoning</a></h4>
<p>ACL 2026 · 扩展相关 · 正文笔记</p>
<p>SpreadsheetAgent 先用 incremental extraction–verification loop 理解 spreadsheet 的结构，再把 verified YAML representation 交给下游 task solver。</p>
<h4 id="value-of-information-a-framework-for-human-agent-communication"><a href="/papers/agent-tool-use-2026/reading/e228/">Value of Information: A Framework for Human–Agent Communication</a></h4>
<p>ACL 2026 · 扩展相关 · 正文笔记</p>
<p>论文用 Value of Information（VoI）决定 agent 应继续 clarification 还是直接 commit：估计一个问题可能带来的 expected decision utility 增益，再扣除 communication cost；只有净收益为正时才询问用户，否则执行当前 belief 下最优 action。</p>
<h4 id="when-agents-look-the-same-quantifying-distillation-induced-similarity-in-tool-use-behaviors"><a href="/papers/agent-tool-use-2026/reading/a23/">When Agents Look the Same: Quantifying Distillation-Induced Similarity in Tool-Use Behaviors</a></h4>
<p>ACL 2026 · 扩展相关 · 正文笔记</p>
<p>论文用 Response Pattern Similarity（RPS）与 Action Graph Similarity（AGS）分别描述 agent 的语言习惯和工具使用习惯，重点比较完成同一任务时的可选行为。</p>
<h2 id="02-多模态感知与创作">02 · 多模态感知与创作</h2>
<p>81 篇 · CVPR 59 · ACL 22</p>
<h4 id="aeroagent-a-vision-physics-decision-framework-for-aerodynamic-vehicle-design"><a href="/papers/agent-tool-use-2026/reading/c8/">AeroAgent: A Vision-Physics-Decision Framework for Aerodynamic Vehicle Design</a></h4>
<p>CVPR 2026 · 直接工具使用 · 正文笔记</p>
<p>AeroAgent 将 text / image-to-3D、aerodynamic surrogate 与 design planner 接成 propose–evaluate–refine loop。</p>
<h4 id="agentic-retoucher-for-text-to-image-generation"><a href="/papers/agent-tool-use-2026/reading/c11/">Agentic Retoucher for Text-To-Image Generation</a></h4>
<p>CVPR 2026 · 直接工具使用 · 正文笔记</p>
<p>Agentic Retoucher 将生成图像的局部修复拆成 perception–reasoning–action loop：先定位 distortion，再解释 defect 类型与上下文原因，最后选择合适的 local editing tool。</p>
<h4 id="arm-thinker-reinforcing-multimodal-generative-reward-models-with-agentic-tool-use-and-visual-reasoning"><a href="/papers/agent-tool-use-2026/reading/c5/">ARM-Thinker: Reinforcing Multimodal Generative Reward Models with Agentic Tool Use and Visual Reasoning</a></h4>
<p>CVPR 2026 · 直接工具使用 · 正文笔记</p>
<p>ARM-Thinker 把 multimodal reward model 从一次性打分器改成会主动取证的 Agent。</p>
<h4 id="beyond-sequential-tools-a-unified-vlm-agent-system-for-photographic-post-processing-via-dynamic-multi-expert-fusion"><a href="/papers/agent-tool-use-2026/reading/c17/">Beyond Sequential Tools: A Unified VLM Agent System for Photographic Post-Processing via Dynamic Multi-Expert Fusion</a></h4>
<p>CVPR 2026 · 直接工具使用 · 正文笔记</p>
<p>该方法让 VLM 诊断图像中的 mixed degradations，再把对应 expert LoRAs 按权重合并进一个 diffusion restoration backbone。</p>
<h4 id="diffgraph-an-automated-agent-driven-model-merging-framework-for-in-the-wild-text-to-image-generation"><a href="/papers/agent-tool-use-2026/reading/c29/">DiffGraph: An Automated Agent-driven Model Merging Framework for In-the-Wild Text-to-Image Generation</a></h4>
<p>CVPR 2026 · 直接工具使用 · 正文笔记</p>
<p>DiffGraph 把不断增长的 T2I expert models 组织成可更新的 graph，根据用户 prompt 检索所需 experts，再激活局部 subgraph 预测 merging coefficients。</p>
<h4 id="don-t-show-pixels-show-cues-unlocking-visual-tool-reasoning-in-language-models-via-perception-programs"><a href="/papers/agent-tool-use-2026/reading/c30/">Don't Show Pixels, Show Cues: Unlocking Visual Tool Reasoning in Language Models via Perception Programs</a></h4>
<p>CVPR 2026 · 直接工具使用 · 正文笔记</p>
<p>Perception Programs（P²）把 depth、optical flow、correspondence 等 vision tool outputs 转为统一的 language-native structured cues，再交给现成 MLLM 推理。</p>
<h4 id="evograph-r1-self-evolving-multimodal-knowledge-hypergraphs-for-agentic-retrieval"><a href="/papers/agent-tool-use-2026/reading/c40/">EvoGraph-R1: Self-Evolving Multimodal Knowledge Hypergraphs for Agentic Retrieval</a></h4>
<p>CVPR 2026 · 直接工具使用 · 正文笔记</p>
<p>EvoGraph-R1 将 Multimodal GraphRAG 的 knowledge hypergraph 视为可被 Agent 修改的环境。</p>
<h4 id="fusionagent-a-multimodal-agent-with-dynamic-model-selection-for-human-recognition"><a href="/papers/agent-tool-use-2026/reading/c45/">FusionAgent: A Multimodal Agent with Dynamic Model Selection for Human Recognition</a></h4>
<p>CVPR 2026 · 直接工具使用 · 正文笔记</p>
<p>FusionAgent 将 face、gait、body recognition models 作为可选择的 tools，让 MLLM 根据当前样本的可见信息逐轮决定调用哪些 experts，随后用 Anchor-based Confidence Top-k（ACT）融合其 scores。</p>
<h4 id="geometrically-constrained-agent-for-spatial-reasoning"><a href="/papers/agent-tool-use-2026/reading/c51/">Geometrically-Constrained Agent for Spatial Reasoning</a></h4>
<p>CVPR 2026 · 直接工具使用 · 正文笔记</p>
<p>Geometrically-Constrained Agent（GCA）先将 spatial query 转成明确的 reference-frame constraint 与 objective constraint，再让 VLM 在这一固定定义下调用 perception 和 geometry tools。</p>
<h4 id="geommbench-and-geommagent-toward-expert-level-multimodal-intelligence-in-geoscience-and-remote-sensing"><a href="/papers/agent-tool-use-2026/reading/c50/">GeoMMBench and GeoMMAgent: Toward Expert-Level Multimodal Intelligence in Geoscience and Remote Sensing</a></h4>
<p>CVPR 2026 · 直接工具使用 · 正文笔记</p>
<p>论文同时提出 GeoMMBench 和 GeoMMAgent：前者用跨 geoscience disciplines、sensor modalities 与 task levels 的专家题目评测能力，后者以 plan–execute–evaluate workflow 组织 retrieval、perception 和 reasoning agents，连接通用模型与 RS 专用工具。</p>
