<h4 id="longvt-incentivizing-thinking-with-long-videos-via-native-tool-calling"><a href="/papers/agent-tool-use-2026/reading/c73/">LongVT: Incentivizing &quot;Thinking with Long Videos&quot; via Native Tool Calling</a></h4>
