<h4 id="resolving-evidence-sparsity-agentic-context-engineering-for-long-document-understanding"><a href="/papers/agent-tool-use-2026/reading/c103/">Resolving Evidence Sparsity: Agentic Context Engineering for Long-Document Understanding</a></h4>
